  "body": "A home full of character, quirks and untapped potential, this one-of-a-kind property offers plenty of possibilities for those with vision.\r\n\r\n*\tIgnore C.V, expectations are not up there\r\n*\tBuilt in the 1950s\r\n*\tFreehold 630sqm site\r\n*\tSpacious 320sqm home spread over three levels\r\n*\tGolf course views\r\n*\tPeaceful cul-de-sac location\r\n*\tJust steps from Waitemata Golf Course\r\n*\tBeaches close by\r\n*\tAn easy walk to Devonport Village\r\n*\tPotential to re-build in the future or live in as is and enjoy\r\n\r\nA must-see property!\r\nWe know real estate agents are always saying a property must be sold… but this time, we're not exaggerating. This deceased estate is genuinely for sale, quirks and all. Bring your vision and explore the possibilities!\r\n\r\nAuction Thursday 17th Dec at 12.00pm (Unless Sold Prior)\r\nTo download property files go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/8FER",
